---
import '../styles/global.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${base}favicon.svg`} />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Admission | PGNX</title>
	</head>
	<body class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-green-50 to-white text-gray-900 relative">

		<div
			class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10"
			style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #16653480 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"
		></div>

		<div class="pointer-events-none fixed left-1/2 top-40 -z-10 h-[500px] w-[500px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-green-300 opacity-20 blur-3xl"></div>

		<!-- Top bar -->
		<header class="relative w-full py-6 px-6 flex items-center justify-end">
			<div class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-1 w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-green-800"></div>
			<a href={base} class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 bg-white rounded-full p-1">
				<img src={`${base}logo.jpg`} alt="PGNX logo" class="h-20 w-20 rounded-full object-cover border border-green-100" />
			</a>
		</header>

		<!-- Side menu toggle tab -->
		<button
			id="menu-toggle"
			class="fixed left-0 top-28 z-40 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 rounded-r-xl bg-green-800 text-white px-2 py-5 [writing-mode:vertical-rl]"
		>
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="[writing-mode:horizontal-tb] rotate-90">
				<path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
				<path d="M9 22V12h6v10"/>
			</svg>
			HOME
		</button>

		<!-- Slide-out side menu -->
		<nav
			id="side-menu"
			class="fixed left-0 top-0 h-full w-64 -translate-x-full bg-green-900 text-white p-6 transition-transform duration-300 z-50"
		>
			<button id="menu-close" class="mb-6 text-sm text-green-200">&#10005; Close</button>
			<ul class="space-y-4 font-medium">
				<li><a href={base} class="hover:text-green-300">Home</a></li>
				<li><a href={`${base}admission`} class="hover:text-green-300">Admission</a></li>
				<li><a href={`${base}visa`} class="hover:text-green-300">Visa</a></li>
				<li><a href={`${base}resources`} class="hover:text-green-300">Resources</a></li>
				<li><a href={`${base}about`} class="hover:text-green-300">About Us</a></li>
				<li><a href={`${base}contact`} class="hover:text-green-300">Contact</a></li>
			</ul>
		</nav>

		<!-- Main content -->
		<main class="px-6 py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">

			<a href={base} class="text-sm text-green-700 hover:text-green-900">&larr; Back to Home</a>

			<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold text-green-800">Admission in Germany</h1>
			<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Everything you need to know before you apply — general requirements, Bachelor's eligibility, and Master's eligibility.</p>

			<!-- General overview -->
			<section class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-green-100 shadow-sm p-8">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-800">General Overview</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Germany is one of the most popular study destinations in the world, and every year thousands
					of Pakistani students make the move to continue their education there. The two most common
					paths are <strong>Bachelor's</strong> and <strong>Master's</strong> programs — each with its
					own eligibility rules, which we've broken down below.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Whichever path fits you, German universities are known for extremely low or even
					<strong> zero tuition fees</strong> at public institutions, strong ties to industry, and
					degrees that are respected internationally — which is exactly why it's become such a
					practical, sought-after choice for building both an education and a career.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- Bachelors -->
			<section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-green-100 shadow-sm p-8">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-800">Bachelor's Admission</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					To be eligible for a Bachelor's program in Germany, you need <strong>13 years of prior
					education</strong>. In Pakistan, students typically complete only <strong>12 years </strong>
					by the time they finish HSSC or A-Levels — which means most Pakistani students are one year
					short of the German requirement.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					The good news: this gap is easy to close. Take admission into any Bachelor's degree program
					in Pakistan and complete its <strong>first two semesters</strong> (i.e. your first year). At
					that point, you've completed 13 years of education in total and become eligible to apply for
					a Bachelor's program in Germany.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-green-50 border border-green-100 p-4 text-sm text-green-800">
					<strong>Example:</strong> You enroll in a 4-year Bachelor's program in Pakistan. After
					finishing just the first 2 semesters, you now meet Germany's 13-year requirement and can
					begin your German university application.
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Masters -->
			<section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-green-100 shadow-sm p-8">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-800">Master's Admission</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					For a Master's program in Germany, the requirement steps up to <strong>16 years of
					education</strong> in total.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Germany also recognizes the <strong>2+2 year Bachelor's structure</strong> used in some
					systems — so as long as your combined years of education add up to 16, you meet the
					eligibility requirement for a Master's application.
				</p>
			</section>

		</main>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="mt-12 border-t border-green-100 py-6 px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
			<p>&copy; 2025 PGNX &mdash; Pakistan Germany Nexus. All rights reserved.</p>
			<div class="flex gap-4">
				<a href="#" aria-label="Facebook" class="hover:text-green-700">FB</a>
				<a href="#" aria-label="Instagram" class="hover:text-green-700">IG</a>
				<a href="#" aria-label="WhatsApp" class="hover:text-green-700">WA</a>
			</div>
		</footer>

		<script>
			const toggle = document.getElementById("menu-toggle");
			const menu = document.getElementById("side-menu");
			const close = document.getElementById("menu-close");

			toggle?.addEventListener("click", () => {
				menu?.classList.remove("-translate-x-full");
			});
			close?.addEventListener("click", () => {
				menu?.classList.add("-translate-x-full");
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>